Moon sighting, sun and moon positions and time zone (v3.0.6)
-----------------------------------------------------------
- moon-sighting 1.2.0 by Aric Camarata — MIT licence. Offline copy in
  src/vendor/moon-sighting.js (telemetry, kernel download and file access
  removed; no maths changed). Used for the Hijri date (Odeh crescent
  criterion) and the sun and moon positions.
- JPL DE442S planetary ephemeris (NASA Jet Propulsion Laboratory, published
  by NAIF), unmodified, in public/ephemeris/de442s.bsp, so it works offline.
- @photostructure/tz-lookup 11.8.0 — CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication).
  Offline copy in src/vendor/tz-lookup.js; finds the time zone of the saved
  location for the reading day.
Full licence texts: src/vendor/LICENSES-v3.0.6.txt.
